1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
This demo uses AI narration for Fuzlullah
Syed, a third-year medical student.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
AI agents can sound reasonable
and still act too late.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
WitnessPatch freezes what the agent knew
at T-plus-two and compiles the missed

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
deadline into a portable red test.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
This fully synthetic baseline scores
fifty, with two critical breaches.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Codex built and stress-tested the compiler
during Build Week; GPT-5.6 Sol

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,000
proposed separate repair data.

8
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Locked code—not the model—scores it and
builds a nine-file Node test bundle.

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:46,000
The test stays red at INV-02,
T-plus-two. The manifest, original inputs,

10
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:52,000
earliest failing prefix, receipt, and
executable test travel together as a

11
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:58,000
conventional Node package. A reviewer can
inspect and run it offline,

12
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:04,000
without an API key, model call,
or target rerun.

13
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:10,000
This is not a canned demo. Compile Your
Files loads a schema-valid synthetic case

14
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:16,000
and failed run. The browser hashes and
regrades them locally; here I load the

15
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:22,000
included pair, confirm it is synthetic,
and compile.

16
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:27,000
The result is the same nine-file red
bundle, with two computed hashes

17
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:32,000
and zero claims of external verification.

18
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:39,000
Back on the reference, the verifier checks
twenty-three saved files and recomputes

19
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:45,000
both runs. The retained repair reaches
one hundred with zero critical failures,

20
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:51,000
while the original regression remains red.

21
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:57,000
The repair must pass four holdouts.
An exact-fact control still passes;

22
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:03,000
an always-escalate mutant fails.
Sol’s proposal stays quarantined, and the

23
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:09,000
browser only interprets constrained data.

24
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:14,000
The receipt records every hash, regrade,
holdout, and requested model setup;

25
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:19,000
it does not claim which model was served.
This is developer tooling for synthetic

26
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:24,000
tests: no patient data, no clinical use,
no physician review, and no clinical

27
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:28,000
validation claim.
